+// S-10 (flow 355, AC6): the old win32 plan, `cmd /c start "" <url>`, spawns
+// `cmd.exe` — a SHELL, which re-tokenises its whole command line. A
+// `verification_uri` containing `&` ends the `start` command there and runs
